                                "sense_id": "2f6077b6-f9ac-396e-a202-35bf72cbcb21",
                                "text": "Fruits ovoid or orbicular, without nutlets at base, narrow into a neck, often underdeveloped, white, greenish white and erubescent only on 1 side"
