                                "example_id": "3ab09488-5ffd-4f3e-a13d-b6fcb6ab020a",
                                "sense_id": "47411187-5483-3ddd-87b6-fee6cda37f05",
                                "text": "I see you on the edge of a mountain,\nI call your name.\nYou turn and give a smile, you hug me and hold me.\nAs the sun goes down,\nYou can see I'm clearly Erubescent.\nI hate and I love it at the same time."
